source_problem:
Find the number of units in the length of diagonal $DA$ of the regular hexagon shown. Express your answer in simplest radical form. [asy]
size(120);
draw((1,0)--(3,0)--(4,1.732)--(3,3.464)--(1,3.464)--(0,1.732)--cycle);
draw((1,0)--(1,3.464));
