source_solution:
We might try sketching a diagram: [asy]
pair pA, pB, pC, pO, pD;
pA = (-15, 0);
pB = (0, 0);
pC = (0, 20);
pO = (0, 10);
pD = (-9.6, 7.2);
draw(pA--pB--pC--pA);
