&=\left(\frac{-13}{5}\right) \cdot \left(\frac{6}{1}\right)\\
&=\frac{(-13) \cdot (6)}{(5) \cdot (1)} \\
&=\frac{-78}{5} \\
&=-\frac{78}{5}.
