label("$R$",(0,0),W);
label("2",(7.0711,7.0711)--(7.0711,-7.0711),E);
label("$45^\circ$",(7.0711,-4.0711),W);
label("$45^\circ$",(7.0711,4.0711),W);
[/asy]

Using four of these triangles, we can create a square of side length $2\text{ cm}$ (thus area $4 \mbox{ cm}^2$).

[asy]
